{"ID":"20230926154750-dnhkmwj","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230926154750-dnhkmwj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926154750-dnhkmwj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926154753-2ry1frd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926154753-q2h0ubu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926154753-q2h0ubu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:17,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:17\u0026#125;","title":"【黄芩加半夏生姜汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230926154753"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230926154753-2ry1frd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926154753-2ry1frd","updated":"20230926154753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：黄芩三两、甘草二两、芍药二两、半夏半升、生姜三两、大枣十二枚"}]},{"ID":"20230926154753-lybckzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926154753-lybckzx","updated":"20230926154753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右六味，以水一斗，煮取三升，去滓，温服一升，日再，夜一服。"}]},{"ID":"20230926154753-q2h0ubu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926154753-q2h0ubu","updated":"20230926154753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干呕而利者，黄芩加半夏生姜汤主之。"}]}]}